  "summary": "This month we received 60 feedback items, stable from last month. A new critical issue emerged: Rating Screen Bugs (13 complaints, all negative) is blocking customers from accessing their carts and ordering after the 5.2 update. Checkout and Payment Issues remain stable at 9 complaints with continued double-charging reports. Positive movement: Order Tracking Inaccurate is improving (14→4) and Promo Codes Not Working is improving (10→3). Note: A separate urgent item (B2-042) involves a life-threatening allergic reaction due to special instructions not reaching restaurants.",
